      "audience": "user",
      "chars": 1664,
      "fileName": "troubleshooting-a-custom-tool-times-out-or-errors-check--4.md",
      "group": "Help",
      "hash": "abae50e67ea571dc",
      "id": "troubleshooting-a-custom-tool-times-out-or-errors-check--4",
      "route": "/docs#troubleshooting",
      "source": "docs",
      "tags": [
        "faq",
        "troubleshooting",
        "help"
      ],
      "title": "A custom tool times out or errors: check the Test dialog first. Tools run sandboxed with public HTTP(S) access (up to 25 network calls and ~90s per run, 180s while testing); heavy ML libraries and private hosts are blocked. Use Storage for files and Code Interpreter for heavy calculations."
    },
    {
      "audience": "user",
      "chars": 990,
      "fileName": "troubleshooting-a-document-stays-processing-ingestion-re-1.md",
      "group": "Help",
      "hash": "a97685aff328515e",
      "id": "troubleshooting-a-document-stays-processing-ingestion-re-1",
      "route": "/docs#troubleshooting",
      "source": "docs",
      "tags": [
        "faq",
        "troubleshooting",
        "help"
      ],
      "title": "A document stays Processing: ingestion retries automatically and a watchdog fails anything stuck past the threshold. Re-upload the document and note its id."
    },
    {
